{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:adac183feb719053d22f4b1e11daab830412962bee06e8bee5c5e97d522a0d48",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e784afc64d81f91dcfc52cf7e2551015d0d50515c1abbecfe6e51d562d98d41",
      "text": "放学后的家庭影院",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a46a0c0b4a3ef8547545114c5f4b4161bac122d74e709099cf208021d5b37ec",
      "text": "在学校被同班同学庆祝了生日，\n秀却总觉得和他们有些距离感，\n并为人际交往的方法而苦恼。\n另一边在C.FIRST的生日派对上，\n两人送上了意想不到的惊喜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e784afc64d81f91dcfc52cf7e2551015d0d50515c1abbecfe6e51d562d98d41",
      "text": "放学后的家庭影院",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1894d357efebc627b2fb76c16ba0755d36559592b42e3d77c9919131d8cab31d",
      "text": "天峰，开会辛苦了。还有生日快乐！\n这是我帮我们班女生代转的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf5684186b374ec1e40768adaa2cdabec88039c4d1ebb37c4ab0685724d0cd6b",
      "text": "是礼物吗，谢谢学长。\n……不过，为什么不直接拿来给我呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c036578f06a08b987947e9887aa3c1ee4205d52a37db785892e58c9ce54d7979",
      "text": "因为天峰你总带着一种让人不敢随便靠近的气场嘛。\n看吧，那群孩子也一直在找跟你搭话的时机呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc0baae151d8511886c8f87008737b14c87dfb76b3825e6fe3a9d442e70e8733",
      "text": "啊……天峰！你今天过生日对吧？\n所以，大家就想着把礼物送给你……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14a8c223a964e3a72671c866783fd4b86a72f51e0c58d6ffe15f5ba8e1b5fab0",
      "text": "哎，还特意准备了啊。谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acc8736516b53fb33338da1e4de59846ffada19c8242e7d6b7644e5745c75637",
      "text": "（其实直接普通地拿给我就行了啊。\n我有那么难搭话吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4fd801578d3120cd8ed3361f2c61c2b0a9470e67c5a41cf5b03ebdeca66e9ab",
      "text": "之后有什么打算？\n果然是和家里人开派对之类的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7f66c52bdf5a652df498c24b202c0385febafd82c50c76fd41e0a9b9ff7edd1",
      "text": "C.FIRST的3个人要一起办生日派对。\n剑羽高中的学生会长，锐心学长邀请我去他家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5cae8d6ba9b5bd212119d3e49b29d171719c271a5108e9413b248d179b0ff69",
      "text": "C.FIRST的3个人聚在一起办派对！？\n好厉害，真想见识一下那样的场面啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64e5c3e6f7fbb5ba08d43dcc59762ca4548d9c373d4d8c6f0ef8cb19f5d4e8a1",
      "text": "这样啊。那，要一起过来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51281a5cd4c59aedb5991820a7517278362214a6fab62f34872c7d6f9765b890",
      "text": "不行不行哪可能啊，那也太惶恐了吧！\n我、我们就先回去了……回见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:473bc865e1d10fbd31ff95886b3d462e3043f2cbbb533a5f2f6d4fae063169f3",
      "text": "（搞什么啊，明明是想着要是能拉近点距离就好了。\n……这种事，还真难办啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30e2e9af93b956ece1d3df80312795dd4d8a5dfe114f7f6d273d7ab9fbba53df",
      "text": "（嘛，现在还是先想想和学长们的派对吧。\n他们会怎么帮我庆祝生日呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "数月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21c420fece1c249519f2ad2663e01d6fd7516bc337179943909c4c8c47722885",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n……咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a6287be93ead812d6e833b7367695fe3066b43e0c58498c553f887657ae03fb",
      "text": "两位竟然在看漫画杂志，真少见呢。\n是有什么在意的作品吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c8ac431082054370a2765481b3af6502608273ecfc9fb8435b870acf11aafb4",
      "text": "听说眉见君喜欢的电影导演，\n接下了一部著名漫画的电影改编工作。所以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:373dd1e5baf09c3991fc0c7d0361b68168c974f03e746826afd4c934b62093c3",
      "text": "我们在收集那部漫画的相关情报。\n就是这部作品，秀知道吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b00e96dca1d3f907e887fbef01b76e1fe3264192b7df223d3ffe23130ecdeda",
      "text": "啊，这个的话我家有全套哦。\n周边和设定集也都有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba30cdb557a4e53158f0251137094f48510eaeca37b7bf496bb1d755a09b2273",
      "text": "哇，好厉害。天峰君的话，\n只要是喜欢作品的相关物品，基本上都会有呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8dad0ec473badbe0d66fb148c1d2317db88f231ff555250103e481dc54ff461",
      "text": "话虽如此……还是有一件一直买不到的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5bed3e1f8d8f02b24bb62d9b3d7c316bde6b651b03adb87e242ada07468605f",
      "text": "是一部很老的动画电影的光盘。\n因为绝版了，怎么找都找不到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14f74748c93a415796bae0100c431f17c9f00a990c7f951eb290d22066a733b4",
      "text": "在核心粉丝圈里被称为“名作！”，\n真想看一次啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000148:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71121103c432c267f823ff67d75c9f1185775691108669e1c31bec21dbccadc",
      "text": "当天回家的路上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2970eb4bf022a8f65cce3a8c2cd6dde18a8fbfeb9f48fd7930d8e23b6480892",
      "text": "……顺利问出了天峰君想要的东西呢。\n眉见君，能准备好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_b:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cdc64e90bbdcc53e6db006560daf9d0fc0cf43c8fb05faa37ece411d93c537d",
      "text": "啊啊。那部作品的话，恐怕\n家里的影音室里应该有当作资料收存才对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "数月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05a2b995b70e24e8a406e20d02de1711266ddae2dcd8aa2598600db9a9c79d57",
      "text": "家里居然有影音室……\n锐心学长家，未免也太大太时尚了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d213c47f21fd54b84c87e03be3b0b2fd97a9470631a0f1789ca6be88f69692f",
      "text": "（要是用那个大屏幕打游戏的话，\n绝对超级爽啊！……啊，难道说）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28693cd739291278f209938c8f5ce930a876cbdcbd989700198a02003726f119",
      "text": "（是在这里玩之前工作时玩过的游戏……？\n哇。那可真是最棒的礼物了啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7614358c27dadd5a7b17a12256efb1c73776257376c4cb6cdce358962364988a",
      "text": "P酱送来的慰劳点心我已经摆好了哦。\n眉见君，差不多要开始了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c9246e07a875f4f9a90025effd197934d56622211471146125893c07966ddf3",
      "text": "嗯。……秀。\n今天我们3个人打算看这个。好好享受吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67ca303c41fc4e104222f557d92bdf9548ee0ac55326096b4044bf8470cc8340",
      "text": "生日快乐，秀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fefe2588f9fc9ccd68f932014241d03194392451b9091293fd85207cf96b9c2",
      "text": "（咦。怎么，开始放电影了……？\n这样啊，原来不是打游戏啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8df14fbe4159e5d74f09570ecd7e7c4ff3918e21dcb1f3dfd35060177537aad",
      "text": "呃，谢谢你们。\n啊，这是年代很久远的动画电影吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a245084de867013e3fc8beaaff4c23cb5b324e897bcf576a49dd478bb3ec0b89",
      "text": "学长们真亏能知道这种面向硬核受众的作品呢。\n话说在我生日的时候，为什么要看这个……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e9f6f314ec7d3c7b44e3fc80106b716375c3615c1e007f2cf6b12b5bbd4e30f",
      "text": "为什么这么问……之前天峰君不是说过，\n想看这部动画的吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000190:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21c5b560a0d0aa387cee483c485d75c08ab0af67c48392911171e8f02f33c2cd",
      "text": "诶。我说过这种话来着吗……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5bed3e1f8d8f02b24bb62d9b3d7c316bde6b651b03adb87e242ada07468605f",
      "text": "是一部很老的动画电影的光盘。\n因为绝版了，怎么找都找不到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000223:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14f74748c93a415796bae0100c431f17c9f00a990c7f951eb290d22066a733b4",
      "text": "在核心粉丝圈里被称为“名作！”，\n真想看一次啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000249:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35f0f11f072f1fe47e117e972e98cd44cf979bac41cd325255217b396a8e9a68",
      "text": "（这么说来，之前确实说过！但是，因为太难入手\n完全买不到，后来兴趣也就淡了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000273:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000282:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef5cf7c0211f0a37f7a7877a67e8b7d6d4fa827972352cf2ddc522afcc42c797",
      "text": "……本想给个惊喜的，结果搞砸了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000286:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f3d9917fffcc54148c2765fc79af92033af9b80f32fb96498c4687bb5b69446",
      "text": "啊啊。看来是我们准备得太早了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000293:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a26201a6d75e23b288d50798c737cdf639852d75cd7925e804a97c2d7262e56e",
      "text": "没有的事！学长们那么早就开始替我准备了啊。\n我只是对这件事感到很惊讶而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000301:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b0f9ed110e293c5cc879fd5364a4ea504184f5b8b7eca4fc5d7c14984178921",
      "text": "所以，惊喜大成功哦。\n按照原定计划，我们3个人一起好好欣赏这部电影吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_c:cmd-000333:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5010105c96e728a1b55cb7b601acd3f9a47c93a34664c79d7763b177af8f2f23",
      "text": "（话是这么圆回来了。\n但要是内容太无聊，派对没热络起来该怎么办啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e64ffd2c5abdbbd5522499a6520d0a2c5317214bceeee57cf4c2da82f71c553e",
      "text": "观影会后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03cd8f7a9bd47ca3f495fdb9e856caf2b10356cb9a9446f0c7ecfa5187d7200a",
      "text": "太厉害了……我之前怎么一直都没看呢。\n看了这部之后，今后看其他作品的眼光也会改变的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c46e57ca864a6eb627c1c0667da81f1ba2aaca417d9837455ea2cbb949511c42",
      "text": "很多手法在现在的作品里也还在沿用，\n有好多能看出是受这部影响的分镜表现……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b123779f792c709a61c715db0e0922837fb7d373fa0b169f0c004574c453441",
      "text": "呵呵，看来你看得很开心，太好了。\n刚才我还提心吊胆以为惊喜搞砸了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6cf1ec24adb36ba1e27138f1ab0b2ea28ef5493068a827ab71124e827c07271",
      "text": "我在看之前也提心吊胆的，生怕让学长们失望了呢。\n然后，刚才说的那个演出表现就是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebfb4bdbb45fa6789e7c47d972e0e52862e094eb9d63b665e5f033ac1b47d371",
      "text": "（……啊，光是我一个人在说了。\n我记得这种时候，锐心学长通常都会……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcb3242a0e5280f0ef6726e632f37554ac9a17c351595a8f6999fc2478427e62",
      "text": "抱歉，光顾着我一个人说了。\n百百人、秀，你们有什么看法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f626dead877b3cdcc6af3eae226a73bc6d56716c9922339deeacd622ba831b",
      "text": "那个，百百人学长觉得怎么样？\n看完这部电影有什么感想吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42ede3016d5e1c61b4ff82720628ce783402537b23580950aa319705b6dc6937",
      "text": "哎～要对天峰君说感想，好怕啊。\n感觉自己可能会说错什么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1bf121160827c107bf7ece0b908d986b3dfa8c62f74f5a3726912cd385bebbc",
      "text": "哪里会有什么对错嘛。\n我只是想听听百百人学长内心最真实的想法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ba1458634a8d357ccd4fcbcf3fbd507343be8cb7b18f95db71fc89de2e1da95",
      "text": "（……正因为你是这么想的，\n才能什么话都能毫无顾虑地说出口吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4fd70f9fb8606e14d7dde5c06cfeb146baf57ff0069a2a85713bb44213b9b6d",
      "text": "（既羡慕，又觉得耀眼得让人难受。但是……\n我又稍微有点希望，自己能变得像你一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_d:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e073dbcb2951b3501210251554fdfcdb5becaea505920256e6a2bd7eefc2ae32",
      "text": "让我想想……\n那么，我比较在意的部分是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c32b4a8978fc3d557738c8ad55c5b91daa2756ade94cdc26630e9152fc25ed9",
      "text": "对，就是那个场景。\n把人类变成数据保存起来这种事，真的做得到吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5b365c1b77e95d1007e1ef6d2531d7a2a55330303f4375b11f696845dc0cf01",
      "text": "啊，是那里啊……顺便问一下百百人学长，要是真有了\n这种技术，会想要把自己的数据保存下来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9c7d7ff6c6dbedc5cbaee810ccb870778c6f2165eb32e650ce95167b8a206dc",
      "text": "嗯——……感觉，不太想吧。至少，\n想等自己变得更帅气一点再说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a8385217471c6830e52c23801c81c63b0e0cf1cbf9e0a80fb7290d70af281d4",
      "text": "我觉得就像这部电影一样，就算保存了那个人的\n言行举止，也并不等于是把那个人本身保存了下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba058f6db72c59c47fbfaaa8ff1366c23178d5ad36c1d96c77ca18e8321699e1",
      "text": "因为人是会不断成长、\n不断变化的嘛，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:074de9f7275e44410a28b8b56144f3439b790d0253990a25cd7de82f5e5a3392",
      "text": "正确的“那个人”本身，\n可以说是根本不存在的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a41b4c139ae5d3601dcaede743e736ccc90093a3a45ac484f7b7cbda00f884a",
      "text": "那么，如果是已经不会成长、不会变化的人呢？\n比方说，死者的话……就能保存了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64855fb0e9bf9cc3a0a3981f797bc8c51b09a4afd3f68714291a3b5a4f5423b9",
      "text": "啊，也是哦。\n那种情况的话……唔——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99e80e295bac00b49c401143a8271fb33fcc6e2f91f336e0e2f83997f3b8027d",
      "text": "首先，必须先去定义“那个人”究竟指的是什么，\n让所有人的认知达成一致才行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000133:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea196826c8181dd506252e6ec938d69c506a79a8f51cee0f23c6018cd2095ac1",
      "text": "生日会后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84f267ff7d809241c42c65619a718b320811e1550ead9245dc6dc0bc0128d935",
      "text": "哈啊，聊得超级热烈……\n太开心了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:304f4572c1f9847074ac688370f39f23bfa85537f2ab6fb9e0efb483e383ebd6",
      "text": "（不过，下次要试着更早一点\n去询问他们两人的意见才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f562382dc0ba90b62da300b367ab57867286ff55ae6a06fb853c943e8ac5f77",
      "text": "……我必须变得不仅顾着自己，\n还要多关注周围的人才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:633a896f62cf07ae6a8ecbd880cda6ecfd1619f65840e72a01c137f599933baa",
      "text": "“暂无新消息、更新”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_e:cmd-000216:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9792bf4f6925c6fa1e7a9e9e744cfc786e13e0c139bbb3297cde56bb8404f70",
      "text": "……你的心里话也是。\n我本应该，更早一点去倾听的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
